Output:
A tested, verified artifact.

Step 3 — Security & Compliance Stage
SAST (Static Application Security Testing)
Dependency scans (Snyk/Trivy)
Container vulnerability scan

Step 4 — CD Pipeline (Deployment Stage)
Deployment depends on environment:
a) Deploy to Dev
Automated deployment
Run integration tests
Smoke tests
b) Deploy to QA
Manual approval
Run functional & regression tests
c) Deploy to Staging
Performance tests, load test
UAT approval
d) Deploy to Production
Based on strategy:
Blue-Green
Canary
Rolling
Infra provisioning (Terraform/CloudFormation)

Step 5 — Monitoring & Feedback
Tools:
CloudWatch
Prometheus + Grafana
ELK/ELK
Jaeger tracing
